WEBVTT

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:30.520
is a positive.

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:32.456
If we forget that,

00:13:32.480 --> 00:13:36.496
if we choose to double down
on the SDGs that we can solve,

00:13:36.520 --> 00:13:42.176
if we go for SDG à la carte
and pick the most easy SDGs,

00:13:42.200 --> 00:13:45.576
then we will have missed
the point of the SDGs,

00:13:45.600 --> 00:13:47.296
we will miss the goals

00:13:47.320 --> 00:13:50.720
and we will have failed
on the promise of the SDGs.

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:52.816
Thank you.

00:13:52.840 --> 00:13:56.480
(Applause)